# ── private working notes ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Business model, pricing, margins and personal context. Stays on this
# machine. The public-facing version of this is README.md.
CONTEXT.txt
# Written in the second person and full of unit economics: margins, break-even,
# revenue projections. README.md is the public version of the same reasoning.
Architecture_V4_Final.html
design-system.html

# Database dumps taken before destructive migrations. Local only.
backend/backups/

